    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0082_5a2af7e9dd1e.png\" style=\"height: 100px; width: 205px;\" /><br />Direction ratios of <math><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Direction Ratios of the line <math><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Since, they are perpendicular<br /><math><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>9</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>14</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenc